### Register First User (Becomes Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "smtpHost": "smtp.gmail.com",
  "smtpPort": 587,
  "smtpUser": "admin@example.com",
  "smtpPassword": "your-app-password",
  "fromEmail": "admin@example.com",
  "useTLS": true
}

###

### Register Additional User (Becomes User)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###

### Update Own Email TTL
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/settings/email-ttl
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailLogTTLDays": 60
}

###

### Get Own Email Logs
GET http://localhost:8080/user/email-logs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Admin - List Users
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Admin - Get User
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Admin - Promote User or Update TTL
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/users/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin",
  "emailLogTTLDays": 90
}

###

### Admin - Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/users/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Send Email (Webhook)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/send-email
x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "recipient@example.com",
  "subject": "Test Email",
  "body": "This is a test email sent via the webhook!",
  "isHTML": false
}

###

### Send HTML Email (Webhook)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/send-email
x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "recipient@example.com",
  "subject": "HTML Test Email",
  "body": "<h1>Hello!</h1><p>This is an <strong>HTML</strong> email.</p>",
  "isHTML": true
}

###
